    },
    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "5fc586b4433e7f4bca14": "My family worked  the Northridge Lumber Mill in what's now Western Plaguelands. They were dedicated to the Dumah family, and now the Scarlet Crusade have taken it over along with all of Hearthglen!$B$BI will not rest until those zealots are wiped from Azeroth."
      },
      "name": "Mickey Levine",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
          "dialogue.5fc586b4433e7f4bca14": {
